   <property name="text">
    <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;After the yeast has fermented the starches and sugars into alcohol, it is time to press and pasteurize!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pressing separates the liquid (sake) from the solid sediments left over from the mixture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pasteurization ensures the yeast die and cannot continue the fermentation process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
   </property>
